      "text": "You can, as long as they're not hybrids. If the packet said hybrid, the new plants might not match the parent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 16.79,
      "end": 22.29,
      "text": "Perfect, those come true from seed. Pick a really ripe tomato and scoop the seeds into a jar with a little water."
